  "contract": [
    "#12508: Honor and Greater Honor stack. Honor 300856 and its ranks 301228 to 301232 (single ally) and Greater",
    "Honor 680280 (every party or raid member nearby) all give Strength through SPELL_AURA_MOD_STAT; rank 6 and",
    "Greater Honor both give 77. Maintainer decision: Greater Honor is the convenience version that buffs the whole",
    "group at once, so the two must not stack. They now share spell_group 2112508 with",
    "SPELL_GROUP_STACK_RULE_EXCLUSIVE_HIGHEST, as AzerothCore does for Blessing of Might and Greater Blessing of",
    "Might. Expected: Greater Honor replaces an equal rank 6 Honor, and a weaker rank 1 Honor cast afterwards does",
    "not apply next to Greater Honor."
  ],
